//   head           - git -C /Volumes/Unreal/red_hope/red_hope rev-parse --short HEAD, after E7's commit lands.
//   base           - the battery snapshot E7's gate left, e.g. 'Saved/baselines/battery_post_e7'.
//   clickSteps     - (integer) the main click test's step count at that HEAD (E7 added none; read it from E7's last PASS log or count RHClickTest.cpp).
//   deepbenchSteps - (integer) the deepbench scene's step count at that HEAD (9 at d842dd0; recount).
//   batteryRuns    - (integer) the expected run count after E8: ls <base>/*.log | wc -l, plus 0 (E8 adds MX12-MX16 INSIDE -market; no new suite).
//   prevVersion    - (integer) RHSaveVersion at HEAD (59 in queue order). E8 bumps it to prevVersion + 1 (ruling 8).
//   e5Built        - (boolean) true if E5 (the Martian currency) is committed at HEAD. In queue order it is. It controls the rate/unit arrays, the
//                    EXCHANGE RATE section, MX12's withdrawal case, MX16's mutation 7, repair (f) and the +5,327 vs +5,057 byte delta. The builder
//                    checks the flag against HEAD (CurrencyTag in RHSaveFrame.h) before writing code and stops if it is wrong.
//   playtestBase   - optional: the playtest baseline file (default Saved/baselines/ind_full_playtest.txt). playtestBaseline is accepted as an alias.

const REPO = '/Volumes/Unreal/red_hope/red_hope'
